        "subject": "=Welcome to Your Coaching Journey!",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #4a6da7;\">Welcome to Your Coaching Journey</h2>\n  \n  <p>Hello {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Registration\"].json[\"firstName\"]}},</p>\n  \n  <p>Thank you for taking the first step on your coaching journey with us! I'm excited to work with you and help you achieve your goals.</p>\n  \n  <p>To get started, I'd like to learn more about you and your specific goals. Please take a few minutes to complete our intake form:</p>\n  \n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://forms.example.com/intake?id={{$node[\"Code - Process Each Registration\"].json[\"id\"]}}\" style=\"background-color: #4a6da7; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;\">Complete Intake Form</a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <p>This information will help me tailor our coaching sessions to your specific needs and ensure we make the most of our time together.</p>\n  \n  <p>Here's what you can expect next:</p>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Complete the intake form</li>\n    <li>Receive an email to schedule your first session</li>\n    <li>Attend your initial coaching session</li>\n    <li>Receive a personalized coaching plan</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <p>If you have any questions before we begin, please don't hesitate to reach out.</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm looking forward to our work together!</p>\n  \n  <p>Best regards,<br>\nYour Coach</p>\n  \n  <hr style=\"border: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;\">\n  \n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777;\">\n    If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser: https://forms.example.com/intake?id={{$node[\"Code - Process Each Registration\"].json[\"id\"]}}\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
