              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an expert coaching assistant. Your task is to analyze client intake information and prepare a concise, helpful briefing for a coach who will be working with this new client."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Create a coach briefing for a new client with the following information:\n\nClient: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"firstName\"]}} {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"lastName\"]}}\nEmail: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"email\"]}}\nPhone: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"phone\"]}}\n\nCoaching Goals: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"coachingGoals\"]}}\n\nPreferred Schedule: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"preferredSchedule\"]}}\n\nAdditional Information: {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"additionalInfo\"]}}\n\nPlease provide:\n1. A brief summary of the client's background and goals\n2. 3-5 key areas to focus on in initial sessions\n3. Suggested coaching approach based on the information provided\n4. 2-3 powerful questions to ask in the first session\n5. Recommended resources that might benefit this client"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
