        "subject": "=Next Steps in Your Coaching Journey",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #4a6da7;\">Thank You for Completing Your Intake Form</h2>\n  \n  <p>Hello {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Submission\"].json[\"firstName\"]}},</p>\n  \n  <p>Thank you for taking the time to complete your coaching intake form. The information you've provided will help me tailor our sessions to your specific needs and goals.</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm excited to begin our coaching journey together! The next step is to schedule your first session.</p>\n  \n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/example-coach/initial-session\" style=\"background-color: #4a6da7; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;\">Schedule Your First Session</a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <p>During this initial 60-minute session, we'll:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Discuss your goals in more detail</li>\n    <li>Establish our coaching relationship</li>\n    <li>Create a preliminary action plan</li>\n    <li>Set expectations for our ongoing work together</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>I've also attached some resources that might be helpful as you prepare for our first session.</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm looking forward to working with you!</p>\n  \n  <p>Best regards,<br>\nYour Coach</p>\n  \n  <hr style=\"border: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;\">\n  \n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777;\">\n    If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser: https://calendly.com/example-coach/initial-session\n  </p>\n</div>",
