        "subject": "=Reminder: Complete Your Coaching Intake Form",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #4a6da7;\">Your Coaching Journey Awaits</h2>\n  \n  <p>Hello {{$node[\"Code - Process Each Reminder\"].json[\"firstName\"]}},</p>\n  \n  <p>I noticed you haven't had a chance to complete your coaching intake form yet. This information is essential for us to make the most of our coaching relationship.</p>\n  \n  <p>To get started with your coaching sessions, please take a few minutes to complete the form:</p>\n  \n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://forms.example.com/intake?id={{$node[\"Code - Process Each Reminder\"].json[\"clientId\"]}}\" style=\"background-color: #4a6da7; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;\">Complete Intake Form</a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <p>If you're having any difficulties with the form or have questions about the coaching process, please don't hesitate to reach out.</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm looking forward to working with you!</p>\n  \n  <p>Best regards,<br>\nYour Coach</p>\n  \n  <hr style=\"border: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;\">\n  \n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777;\">\n    If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser: https://forms.example.com/intake?id={{$node[\"Code - Process Each Reminder\"].json[\"clientId\"]}}\n  </p>\n</div>",
